  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cook fusilli in the boiling water until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people). Drain fusilli and return to saucepan. Little cooks: Older kids, help add the pasta to the saucepan under adult supervision. Be careful, the water is boiling!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a50e64a619a9a7b40d9f1a/step-222d985f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the saucepan with cooked pasta, add light cooking cream, shaved Parmesan cheese, garlic & herb seasoning, basil pesto, baby spinach leaves, reserved pasta water and a pinch of salt and pepper. Stir to combine.\n• Transfer pasta to a baking dish. Top with shredded Cheddar cheese. Bake until cheese is melted and golden, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a50e64a619a9a7b40d9f1a/step-85ddd166.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pasta is baking, slice tomato into thin wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato, roasted almonds, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season. Little cooks: Help wash and toss the salad!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a50e64a619a9a7b40d9f1a/step-caa7bd22.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy basil pesto pasta bake between plates.\n• Serve with tomato salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a50e64a619a9a7b40d9f1a/step-ebb5e73f.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
